<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <title>403 | Т-Банк</title>
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="30" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/system/favicon.png" type="image/png" />
    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "haas";
        src: url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.woff2") format("woff2"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.woff") format("woff"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.eot") format("eot"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.ttf") format("ttf");
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "TinkoffSans";
        src: url("/system/fonts/TinkoffSans.woff2") format("woff2"),
        url("/system/fonts/TinkoffSans.woff") format("woff");
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      html {
        font-family: sans-serif;
        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }

      body {
        padding: 0 16px;
        margin: 32px auto;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 288px;
        color: #333;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-family: haas, pragmatica, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
          Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 600px) {
        body {
          margin-top: 48px;
          margin-bottom: 48px;
          font-size: 17px;
          line-height: 1.41;
          max-width: 512px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        body {
          max-width: 608px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
        body {
          max-width: 536px;
        }
      }

      a,
      button {
        color: #1771E6;
        text-decoration: none;
        background-color: transparent;
      }

      a:active,
      a:hover,
      button:hover {
        outline: none;
        color: #1464cc;
      }

      button:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.48);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.48);
      }

      button:hover,
      button:active {
        box-shadow: none;
        border-color: currentColor;
      }

      img {
        border-style: none;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      svg:not(:root) {
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .logoWrapper {
        font-size: 0;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }

      .picture {
        margin: 0 auto 35px auto;
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 96px;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 800px) {
        .picture {
          max-height: none;
        }
      }

      .title {
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        font-family: TinkoffSans,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 30px;
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 600px) {
        .title {
          font-size: 36px;
          line-height: 40px;
        }
      }

      .content {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
        color: #666;
      }

      .links {
        margin: 36px 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .links__item {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .links__item:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 600px) {
        .links {
          margin-left: -12px;
          margin-right: -12px;
        }

        .links__item {
          margin-right: 12px;
          margin-left: 12px;
          display: inline-block;
        }
      }

      .logo {
        max-width: 100px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="logoWrapper">
      <a href="/"
        ><img class="logo" src="/system/images/logo.svg" alt="Т-Банк"
      /></a>
    </div>

    <img class="picture" alt="403" src="/system/images/403.svg" />

    <h1 id="title" class="title">Страница недоступна</h1>

    <div class="content">
      У&nbsp;вас недостаточно прав, чтобы открыть эту страницу<br />Попробуйте
      перейти на&nbsp;<a class="links__link" href="/">tinkoff.ru</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="links">
      <li class="links__item">
        <a
          class="links__link"
          href="https://www.tinkoff.ru/cards/credit-cards/"
          >Кредитные карты</a
        >
      </li>
      <li class="links__item">
        <a
          class="links__link"
          href="https://www.tinkoff.ru/cards/debit-cards/"
          >Дебетовые карты</a
        >
      </li>
      <li class="links__item">
        <a class="links__link" href="https://www.tinkoff.ru/deposits/"
          >Вклады</a
        >
      </li>
      <li class="links__item">
        <a class="links__link" href="https://www.tinkoff.ru/"
          >Tinkoff.ru</a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>

    <script src="/system/script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
